---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import img1 from "../../images/Page1.png";
import img2 from "../../images/Page2.png";
import img3 from "../../images/Page3.png";
import img4 from "../../images/Page4.jpeg";
import img5 from "../../images/Page5.png";
import img6 from "../../images/eg-wip1.jpg";
import img7 from "../../images/eg-wip2.jpg";
import img8 from "../../images/eg-wip3.jpg";
import img9 from "../../images/eg-wip6.jpg";
const pages = [
  { src: img1, alt: "It Shall Pass Page 1" },
  { src: img2, alt: "It Shall Pass Page 2" },
  { src: img3, alt: "It Shall Pass Page 3" },
  { src: img4, alt: "It Shall Pass Page 4" },
  { src: img5, alt: "It Shall Pass Page 5" }
];
const wippages = [
  { src: img6, alt: "It Shall Pass WIP 1" },
  { src: img7, alt: "It Shall Pass WIP 2" },
  { src: img8, alt: "It Shall Pass WIP 3" },
  { src: img9, alt: "It Shall Pass WIP 6" }
];
---
<MainLayout title="It Shall Pass | Illustration Series">
    <section class="container">
        <h1 class="title heading">It Shall Pass</h1>
        <div class="image-list">
            {pages.map((page) => (
                <Image src={page.src} alt={page.alt} />
            ))}
        </div>
        <h3>Color Pencil, Digital</h3>
        <p>
            This is a series of images I created as a part of the Illustration and Visual Storytelling residency at the School of Visual Arts.
        </p>
        <p>
            This project merges my past and present through how this song,
        everythinggoes by RM, got me through difficult times in college and
        my current exploration of art mediums. I experimented through
        collaging color pencil elements with digital rendering.
        The transparent person and the more painterly aspects of this work
        are very different from each other but I wanted that to represent
        the honest truth of where I’m at in my artistic journey.
        </p>
        <div class="image-list">
            {wippages.map((page) => (
                <Image src={page.src} alt={page.alt} />
            ))}
        </div>
        <h3>Process</h3>
        <p>For the residency, we were required to produce between 5-8 separate images of work based on a text. Each session (met once a week for 4 weeks), we would continue to work and iterate on our pieces while getting 1-on-1 feedback from our professor.</p>
        <p>I started off with creating more thumbnail sketches than I needed and narrowed down to the ideas that worked better. Afterwards, I sketched each of the images on larger paper. From there, I scanned in my sketches and finished each image digitally. I wanted to explore with different mediums so I tried a mixed media approach by drawing certain elements of each image in color pencil. </p>
    </section>
</MainLayout>
<style>
.container {
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
}
img {
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 300px;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
}
.image-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    grid-gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: left;
}
</style>